# Configuration Groups
# ============================================
KSEF_IMPORTING_CONFIG=Importing
KSEF_BATCH_AUTO_CREATE_SUPPLIERS_SETTING=Auto-create suppliers during import
KSEF_BATCH_AUTO_CREATE_SUPPLIERS_SETTING_Help=Whether the "Auto-create suppliers" box starts ticked on the single and the batch import of incoming invoices. When ticked, a supplier that cannot be matched to an existing third party by NIP (Polish tax ID) or EU VAT number is created with the name, address and tax identifiers from the KSeF invoice. The box can be changed on each import; that choice is not saved here.
KSEF_BATCH_AUTO_CREATE_CUSTOMERS_SETTING=Auto-create customers and third entities during import
KSEF_BATCH_AUTO_CREATE_CUSTOMERS_SETTING_Help=Whether the "Auto-create customers and third entities" box starts ticked on the single and the batch import of KSeF invoices on the Outgoing invoices list. When ticked, a customer or a third entity that cannot be matched to an existing third party is created from the KSeF invoice (third entities only while they are turned on on this page). The box can be changed on each import; that choice is not saved here.
KSEF_BATCH_AUTO_CREATE_PRODUCTS_SETTING=Auto-create products during batch import
KSEF_BATCH_AUTO_CREATE_PRODUCTS_SETTING_Help=When enabled, products that cannot be matched to an existing product will be automatically created during batch import. Matching is attempted by product ref, supplier ref, and barcode/GTIN. New products are created with the description, ref, price, VAT rate, and barcode from the invoice line. If you do not need to track products or link invoice lines to your product catalog, you can leave this disabled - all unmatched lines will still be imported as free text descriptions. This setting is the default for batch imports and is remembered from the last batch import.
KSEF_PRODUCT_REF_USE_INDEKS_SETTING=Use supplier's product code (indeks) as product ref when auto-creating
KSEF_PRODUCT_REF_USE_INDEKS_SETTING_Help=When enabled, the supplier's product index code from the invoice line is used as the product reference when auto-creating new products. When disabled, Dolibarr's automatic numbering sequence is used instead.
KSEF_CUSTOMER_EXCLUSIONS=Customer Exclusions
KSEF_Configuration=KSeF configuration

