# ============================================
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_NRKLIENTA=Include Customer Code
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_NRKLIENTA_Help=Include the Dolibarr customer code in the FA3 invoice XML.
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_INDEKS=Include Product Index Code
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_INDEKS_Help=Include the product reference code in invoice line items.
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_GTIN=Include GTIN/EAN Barcode
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_GTIN_Help=Include product barcodes as GTIN in invoice line items. Enable only if your barcodes are valid GTIN/EAN codes (not internal codes).
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_UNIT=Include Unit of Measure
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_UNIT_Help=Write the unit of measure of each line. Needs units of measure in Dolibarr (Setup > Products, PRODUCT_USE_UNITS). The text for each unit is set in the "Units of measure" table below.
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_BANK_DESC=Include Bank Account Description
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_BANK_DESC_Help=Include the bank account label/description in payment section. Enable only if your account labels are suitable for external visibility (not internal-only names).
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_CONTACT=Include Buyer and Third Party Contact Details
KSEF_FA3_INCLUDE_CONTACT_Help=Include the email and phone of the buyer and of third parties on KSeF invoices. Disable to omit them for everyone; individual third parties can also be opted out on their card.
KSEF_ExtraFieldHideContact=Hide contact on KSeF invoice
KSEF_ExtraFieldHideContactHelp=Omit this third party's email and phone from KSeF invoices (as buyer or as a third party), even if enabled globally. The data stays in Dolibarr.
KSEF_ExtraFieldHideEori=Hide EORI on KSeF invoice
KSEF_ExtraFieldHideEoriHelp=Omit this customer's EORI number from KSeF invoices. The data stays in Dolibarr.
KSEF_ExtraFieldVatGroup=VAT group (GV)
KSEF_ExtraFieldVatGroupHelp=Tick when this customer is a VAT group. Its KSeF invoices then say they concern a VAT group member; name the member on the invoice as a third entity with role 10.
KSEF_ExtraFieldJst=Local government unit (JST)
KSEF_ExtraFieldJstHelp=Tick when this customer is a local government unit. Its KSeF invoices then say they concern a subordinate unit; name the unit on the invoice as a third entity with role 8.
KSEF_ConfigureOfflineCertificate=Configure offline signing certificate for KSeF unavailability periods (tryb awaryjny)
KSEF_FA3_PLACE_OF_ISSUE=Place of Issue
KSEF_FA3_PLACE_OF_ISSUE_Help=Optional field indicating the city/location where the invoice was issued.
KSEF_FA3_PLACE_OF_ISSUE_DISABLED=Disabled
KSEF_FA3_PLACE_OF_ISSUE_COMPANY=From company address (city)
KSEF_FA3_PLACE_OF_ISSUE_CUSTOM=Custom value
KSEF_FA3_PLACE_OF_ISSUE_CUSTOM_Placeholder=Enter city name...
KSEF_FA3_SALE_DATE_SOURCE=Default Date of Sale Source
KSEF_FA3_SALE_DATE_SOURCE_Help=Controls how the sale date field is filled. "Linked delivery/order date" stores the shipment date, order delivery date or order date when one exists. "Invoice date" stores nothing. An empty field means the sale date is the invoice date and follows any later change of it. The field can be filled by hand.
KSEF_FA3_SALE_DATE_SOURCE_INVOICE=Invoice date (stores nothing)
KSEF_FA3_SALE_DATE_SOURCE_DELIVERY=Linked delivery/order date (default)

# Invoice Notes and Custom Fields (DodatkowyOpis in KSeF XML)
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_SECTION=Invoice Notes and Custom Fields
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_NOTE_MODE=Public Note Mode
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_NOTE_MODE_Help=Controls how the invoice public note is included in the KSeF XML.<br><b>Simple - Footer</b> sends the note as plain text in the invoice footer. This is the default.<br><b>Simple - Additional description</b> sends the full note as a key-value entry with key "Uwagi", splitting into 256-character chunks if needed.<br><b>Key:Value - Additional description</b> parses each line at the first colon into separate key-value entries.<br><b>Disabled</b> omits the note from the KSeF XML entirely.
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_NOTE_MODE_DISABLED=Disabled (note not included)
KSEF_NOTE_COMBINED_SIMPLE_STOPKA=Simple - Stopka Faktury (invoice footer as plain text)
KSEF_NOTE_COMBINED_SIMPLE_DODATKOWY=Simple - Dodatkowy Opis (additional description as "Uwagi" entry)
KSEF_NOTE_COMBINED_KEYVALUE_DODATKOWY=Key:Value - Dodatkowy Opis (parse note lines into key-value entries)
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_EXTRAFIELDS=Include Extrafields
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_FACTURE_TITLE=Invoice Fields
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_DET_TITLE=Invoice Line Fields
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_PRODUCT_TITLE=Product Fields
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_SOCIETE_TITLE=Third Party Fields
KSEF_NOTE_SETTINGS_SECTION=Note Settings
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_PREVIEW=Notes Preview
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_PREVIEW_ENTRIES=Expand to see
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_PREVIEW_NRWIERSZA=Line No.
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_PREVIEW_KEY=Key
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_PREVIEW_VALUE=Value
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_HINT_SIMPLE=<b>Simple mode:</b> the note will be sent as a single entry with key "Uwagi". If the text exceeds 256 characters, it will be split into numbered entries (Uwagi, Uwagi 2, Uwagi 3, ...).
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_HINT_KEYVALUE=<b>Key:Value mode:</b> each line is parsed at the first colon. Example: <code>Order number: ZAM/2026/001</code><br>Lines without a colon are ignored. Both "Key:Value" and "Key: Value" (with space) work.
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_HINT_EXTRAFIELDS=Plus %s extrafield(s) configured in module settings will also be included.
KSEF_DODATKOWY_OPIS_NOTE_NO_ENTRIES=No entries yet. Start typing to see the breakdown.
