KSEF_MULTICURRENCY_CONFIG=Multicurrency / NBP settings
KSEF_NBP_RATE_MODE=NBP rate mode
KSEF_NBP_RATE_MODE_Help=What stays when the NBP rate is applied to an invoice in a foreign currency. The amounts in the invoice currency are always the invoice: the PLN amounts are calculated from them at the NBP rate, so the PLN VAT equals the VAT sent to KSeF. Keep invoice currency amounts: the currency amounts do not change. Keep PLN unit prices: on a draft, the currency unit prices are recalculated from the PLN unit prices at the new rate, and the PLN totals can then move by a grosz. A validated invoice always keeps its currency amounts.
KSEF_NBP_RATE_MODE_KEEP_BASE=Keep PLN unit prices (drafts) - currency prices recalculated from them
KSEF_NBP_RATE_MODE_KEEP_FOREIGN=Keep invoice currency amounts (recommended) - PLN amounts calculated from them
KSEF_NbpModeNotice=The NBP rate mode is now <b>Keep invoice currency amounts</b>. The amounts in the invoice currency are the invoice: the module keeps them as entered and calculates the PLN amounts from them at the NBP rate, so the PLN VAT in Dolibarr equals the VAT sent to KSeF. The earlier setting kept the PLN totals and recalculated the currency amounts, which could change the currency amounts by a cent. Existing invoices were not changed. To go back, choose <b>Keep PLN unit prices</b> in the NBP rate mode below: it keeps the PLN unit prices of draft invoices, and their PLN totals can move by a grosz.
KSEF_NBP_SYNC_CURRENCIES=Currencies to sync (NBP cron)
KSEF_NBP_SYNC_CURRENCIES_Help=Currencies enabled in the Multicurrency module. Leave empty to sync them all, or pick specific ones for the daily NBP cron.
KSEF_NBP_SYNC_CURRENCIES_All=All currencies
KSEF_NBP_NoForeignCurrency=The Multicurrency module has only %s. To issue an invoice in another currency (e.g. EUR), first add that currency in the Multicurrency module setup.
KSEF_NBP_OpenCurrencies=Open the currency setup
KSEF_MulticurrencyRefreshDisabled=Disabled for KSeF: use the "%s" button in the NBP rate date field instead
KSEF_MulticurrencyRefreshDisabledNoButton=Disabled for KSeF: the rate comes from the NBP table shown in the NBP rate date field

