KSEF_CorrectionInvoicesSection=Corrective Invoices
KSEF_CorrectionInvoicesDesc=A corrective invoice is sent to KSeF referencing the original, which must be in KSeF first. It handles any change and also corrects paid invoices: the payments stay on the original invoice and the amount already paid is deducted from what the corrective invoice leaves to pay. A Dolibarr credit note can only reduce amounts.
