KSEF_KOR_LINE_METHOD_Help=How corrective invoice line items are presented in the FA(3) XML. Credit notes always use Differential regardless of this setting (reconstructing before/after state from a credit note is not supported). Default: Before/After.
KSEF_KOR_LINE_METHOD_DIFFERENTIAL=Differential - delta lines only
