KSEF_CorrectionStockShortTitle=Stock would not match the documents
KSEF_CorrectionStockShortText=Negative stock is not allowed and the warehouse no longer holds enough of the goods %s put back to stock (sold again since). The module cannot take them all back out, so the stock would not match the documents:%sRecommended: cancel, add the missing goods to stock (a reception or a stock correction), then do this again. "Proceed anyway" goes on and leaves the stock as shown; correct it by hand later.
KSEF_CorrectionStockShortProceed=Proceed anyway
KSEF_CorrectionStockShortCancel=Cancel
KSEF_CorrectionStockUndoSkippedRefused=%s: negative stock is not allowed and the warehouse no longer holds the correction's goods (sold since), so Dolibarr cannot take them out and the module cannot fully undo the correction; the stock or the average price would be left wrong: %s. Refused. Add the missing goods to stock (a reception or a stock correction) first, then try again; on the invoice card you can also go on anyway.
KSEF_CorrectionStockUndoSkippedOverride=%s back to draft: negative stock is not allowed, so Dolibarr did not take the correction's goods out of stock and the module put back that much less (you chose to go on anyway). The stock or the average price no longer matches the documents: %s. Correct them by hand.
