KSEF_CorrectionDraftHint=This correction replaces the original. Edit line items to show what the corrected invoice should contain - the system calculates differences automatically.
KSEF_CreditNoteDraftHint=This correction subtracts from the original. Enter only the amounts to reduce or return.
KSEF_CorrectionOriginalNoKsef=Original invoice has not been submitted to KSeF. The correction will reference only the invoice number, not a KSeF number.
KSEF_CorrectionOriginalProductionOnly=Original invoice %s is issued in KSeF in the production environment. In the %s environment the corrective invoice cannot cite its KSeF number and refers only to the invoice number; sent in production, it cites the KSeF number.
KSEF_CorrectionOriginalProductionOffline=Original invoice %s is issued in the production environment as an offline invoice and has no KSeF number yet. In the %s environment the corrective invoice refers only to the invoice number. In production it cannot be sent, nor issued offline, until KSeF assigns the original's number; then it cites that number.
KSEF_CorrectionOriginalAwaitingNumber=Original invoice %s was issued offline and KSeF has not assigned its number yet. A corrective invoice may be issued only after the original has its KSeF number (art. 106nda ust. 12 and art. 106nf ust. 11 of the VAT Act), so it can be neither sent nor issued offline now. Send the original invoice to KSeF first. Once it has its number, this corrective invoice can be sent, also offline.
KSEF_CorrectionOriginalAwaitingAcceptance=Original invoice %s was sent to KSeF, but KSeF has not accepted it yet, so it has no KSeF number. The corrective invoice must give that number, so it can be neither sent nor issued offline now. Check the status of the original invoice first. Once it has its number, this corrective invoice can be sent, also offline.
KSEF_CorrectionBeforeSourceNumber=The corrective invoice is dated %s, before KSeF assigned the number of the original invoice %s (%s). A corrective invoice may be issued only after the original has its KSeF number (art. 106nda ust. 12 and art. 106nf ust. 11 of the VAT Act). Return it to draft with Modify, set its date to that day or later, and validate it again.
KSEF_CorrectionRedatedAfterSourceNumber=This corrective invoice was dated before KSeF assigned the number of the original invoice %s (%s), so its date is now today, %s.
KSEF_CorrectionOriginalProductionRejected=Original invoice %s is issued in the production environment as an offline invoice, and KSeF rejected it there. In the %s environment the corrective invoice refers only to the invoice number. In production it cannot be sent until KSeF accepts a technical correction of the original invoice; then it cites the original's KSeF number.
