KSEF_SetoffDateHelp=Excess credit from a correction used to pay this invoice is a set-off (offsetting the credit against this invoice). The cash-method VAT report counts the used credit as a payment received on the set-off date. By default this is the day the credit was applied; you can set another date, for example the date of a set-off agreement. It cannot be earlier than the correction that created the credit nor in the future.
