KSEF_DbP_ImportRate=Imported from KSeF at a different exchange rate from the one the invoice states: Dolibarr %s, KSeF %s PLN per 1 %s. All PLN amounts follow the wrong rate (VAT in PLN: Dolibarr %s, KSeF %s).
KSEF_DbP_ImportRateInverted=The rate is stored inverted, as version 1.4.5 imported it.
KSEF_DbP_ImportRateChain=Its corrective invoices %s have the same rate.
KSEF_DbR_ImportRateFixed=Rate from %s to %s, VAT in PLN from %s to %s
KSEF_DbP_ForeignPln=Foreign currency invoice whose PLN amounts are not its own amounts converted at %s PLN per 1 %s (each VAT rate converted as a whole, as the KSeF invoice states it). Net / VAT in PLN: Dolibarr %s, converted %s.
KSEF_DbP_ForeignPlnMc=VAT in %s: Dolibarr %s, calculated per VAT rate from the net amount %s (rounding of the total is on).
KSEF_DbR_ForeignPlnFixed=VAT in PLN from %s to %s
KSEF_DbP_ExcessWhileOwed=Dolibarr made a credit of %s from an "excess", but in %s, %s is still left to pay. The PLN amount went below zero because of exchange rates (for example a deposit or correction at another rate, or a PLN payment at the bank's rate), and Dolibarr does not check the invoice currency.
KSEF_DbF_ExcessWhileOwed=Report only, nothing is changed. Delete this unused credit on the third party's discounts page and reopen the invoice if it is closed. Then enter the payment of the rest or, if it was paid in full and the difference comes from a bank fee or the exchange rate, close the invoice as partially paid with a reason.
KSEF_DbF_ExcessWhileOwedUsed=Report only, nothing is changed. The credit is already used on %s: unlink it there and delete it, then reopen this invoice if it is closed. Then enter the payment of the rest or close the invoice as partially paid with a reason (bank fee, exchange difference).
KSEF_DbP_PaidWhileOwed=The invoice is marked paid with no reason, although in %s, %s is still left to pay (in PLN: %s). Dolibarr closes an invoice when the PLN amount is covered and does not check the invoice currency.
KSEF_DbF_PaidWhileOwed=Report only, nothing is changed. What to do depends on how the money came in: reopen the invoice, then enter the payment of the rest or close it as partially paid with a reason (bank fee, exchange difference). If the shortfall is already accepted, leave the invoice closed.
KSEF_DbF_PaidWhileOwedBefore=Closed before the KSeF module was updated to 1.5.0 (%s), when the module did not check this yet: information only, nothing is changed. If needed, reopen the invoice, then enter the payment of the rest or close it as partially paid with a reason.
