KSEF_HowTo_ContactDesc=Outgoing settings decide whether the buyer's e-mail and phone go into the invoice. A customer can override it on its card ("Hide contact on KSeF invoice"), and its EORI can be left out the same way ("Hide EORI"). The data stays in Dolibarr.
KSEF_HowTo_NbpTitle=NBP exchange rates
