KSEF_HowTo_JobsIntroTitle=Scheduled jobs
KSEF_HowTo_JobsIntro=The module registers these jobs in Dolibarr's Scheduled jobs module. They run only when that module is enabled and a system scheduler calls scripts/cron/cron_run_jobs.php. The About tab shows their state.
