KSEF_TourUi_Recheck=Check again
KSEF_TourUi_Paused=The window "{title}" is open. Choose what to do in it or close it; the guide waits and goes on once it is closed.
KSEF_TourUi_PausedPlain=A window is open. Choose what to do in it or close it; the guide waits and goes on once it is closed.
KSEF_TourUi_PauseBackdated=The "Backdated invoice" window: choose in it how to send the invoice. The guide waits and goes on after your choice.
KSEF_TourUi_PauseFailure=The sending error window: read the reason and choose in it what to do next. The guide waits and goes on after your choice.
KSEF_TourUi_SideBack=When you are done on this page, click "Go back": the guide returns to the previous page with what you entered and goes on.
KSEF_TourUi_Return=Go back
KSEF_Tour_Gate_send=Before you start: without these settings the invoice will not be sent to KSeF. Complete what is missing (link next to the item). The guide checks them by itself each time you come back to the page and starts once nothing is missing.
KSEF_Tour_Gate_receive=Before you start: without these settings purchase invoices will not be fetched or imported. Complete what is missing (link next to the item). The guide checks them by itself each time you come back to the page and starts once nothing is missing.
KSEF_Tour_Gate_offline=Before you start: an offline invoice needs an offline certificate. The item below says where to get it; you upload it on the "Authentication" tab (link next to the item). The guide checks it by itself each time you come back to the page.
KSEF_Tour_GateFix_offline_cert=Here: in the offline certificate form choose "Certificate File" (.crt) and "Private Key File" (.key), type the "Private Key Password" when the key has one, and click "Save Offline Certificate". A red message at the top of the page says what to fix.
KSEF_Tour_GateFix_auth=Here: click the framed login test button. A green message at the top of the page ticks this item.
KSEF_Tour_GateFix_auth_saved=Here: paste the token from the KSeF Taxpayer Application into the framed field and click "Save" under it.
KSEF_Tour_GateFix_company_nip=Here: type the company NIP (10 digits) in the framed field and save the page with the button at its bottom.
